(card "exp:H-R3b-2_c84_kelly_lambda_0.5" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R3b-2_c84_kelly_lambda_0.5"
  :body "---\nnav: 4\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R3b-2\nshort_name: c84_kelly_lambda_0.5\ntitle: \"H-R3b-2 — C8.4 × Kelly-fraction sizing λ=0.5\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r3b\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.6176\ntrain_trade_count: 179\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8771\ntrain_sharpe: 7.8109\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0062\nval_nav_mean: 1.1005\nval_nav_sigma: 0.1102\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4669\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.6190\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0039\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T03:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r3b, axis/sizing, status/challenger, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# H-R3b-2 — C8.4 × Kelly-fraction sizing λ=0.5\n\n> **TL;DR** —— R3b sweep λ=0.5 档（弱放大 deviation）。train NAV 3.62 / test 1.47，仍 strict beat anchor，但 vs λ=1.5 ([[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]]) 略低。mean_size 1.156（中间档）。**val sharpe 7.81 最高** —— \"more conservative sizing → less per-trade variance\"。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- λ=0.5 = 把 ratio/median 偏离压低一半，size 更平稳 → 单笔 variance 低、sharpe 高但 NAV 收益慢。\n- 与 R3b-1 (λ=0.25) / R3b-3 (λ=1.0) / R3b-4 (λ=1.5) 共同检验 \"λ↑ → NAV↑ / sharpe↓\" 的 trade-off。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_3b_runner.py`\n- 公式：\n\n  $$\n  \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(0.5 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{r_t}{\\widetilde{r}^{\\;\\text{past-30d}}_{\\,t}} - 1\\right) + 1,\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right)\n  $$\n\n- mean_size = 1.156, std_size = 0.252（vs λ=1.5 std 0.387，明显更紧）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 与 H-R3b-4 共用 `rolling_30d_ratio_median`，strict past-only / warmup=10。\n- critic audit pass。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.6176 | 179 | 7.81 | 87.7% | -0.62% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.1005 ± 0.110 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4669 | 31 | 7.62 | 80.6% | -0.39% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.218 | +11 | +0.47 | +5.6pp | +0.14pp |\n| **Δ vs R3b-4** | -0.024 | 0 | +0.25 | 0 | +0.04pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。单一 grid 一次性提交。\n- 注意：sharpe 实际比 R3b-4 高 0.25，max_dd 也更小 —— **如果 risk-budget 紧**，R3b-2 是更稳妥的 production 选择，NAV trade off 仅 1.6%。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]]\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]]\n- **dominates**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-1__c84_kelly_lambda_0.25]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-3__c84_kelly_lambda_1.0]]\n- **builds on**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R3b-2 row)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 把 R3b-2 留下来不是给 SOTA 排队，是因为它是**\"NAV ↔ sharpe trade-off curve\"** 的实证点。下次类似 sizing arc 可以画 (λ, NAV, sharpe, dd) 4D 曲线，R3b-2 是 sharpe-优档的代表。\n- production 切上线 SOTA 时，若 risk team push back NAV-max 的 max_dd，可降级到 R3b-2（max_dd -0.39% vs R3b-4 -0.43%）。\n"
